### Variáveis Globais
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@userId = 8
@postId = 1
@tagId = 1

# ==========================================
# TESTES DE USUÁRIO (/api/users)
# ==========================================

### Teste Simples
GET http://localhost:3000/api

### Cadastrar Usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "joaosilva",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "senha_segura_123",
  "name": "João Silva",
  "userType": 1,
  "profession": "Desenvolvedor",
  "institution": "IFSP"
}

### Autenticar (Login)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "senha_segura_123"
}

### Validar Username
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/check-username
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "info": "joaosilva"
}

### Obter Usuário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Atualizar Perfil do Usuário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "field": "profession",
  "newValue": "Engenheiro de Software"
}

### Realizar Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/logout

### Deletar Usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}


# ==========================================
# TESTES DO FÓRUM (/api/forum)
# ==========================================

### Pesquisa Global (Fórum)
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/search?q=ajuda&tagId=1

### Criar Comentário / Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorId": 1,
  "content": "Alguém sabe como resolver o erro de CORS no Node.js?"
}

### Remover Comentário / Post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/comments/{{postId}}

### Verificar se Tag Existe
GET {{baseUrl}}/forum/tags/exists?tagName=javascript

### Criar Nova Tag
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tagName": "javascript"
}

### Associar Tag a um Comentário/Post
POST {{baseUrl}}/forum/comments/{{postId}}/tags
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tagId": 1
}

### Desassociar Tag de um Comentário/Post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/comments/{{postId}}/tags/{{tagId}}

### Remover Tag do Sistema
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/forum/tags/{{tagId}}